\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This may help you avoid becoming overly attached to your own judgment.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Build on it by:
\f0\b0  creating explicit opportunities to be wrong:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ask someone to challenge your assumptions.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Publicly change your mind when evidence warrants it.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Keep a short \'93prediction vs. outcome\'94 log.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How it regulates risk:
\f0\b0  Humility can interrupt overconfidence and reduce the tendency to rationalize questionable means.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

